# Store text files as LF and check them out as LF on every platform.
#
# Keep this rule in step with .editorconfig's end_of_line setting: .editorconfig
# drives the C# formatter, while this file makes Git honour the same rule for
# every clone. Without it Git applies each contributor's core.autocrlf, and the
# Windows default (autocrlf=true) checks files out as CRLF, which fails
# `dotnet format --verify-no-changes` on every .cs file and gives the POSIX test
# fixtures CRLF shebangs.
* text=auto eol=lf
